{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_08",
  "title": "罗德岛大食堂",
  "storyCode": "DT-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f31633122302c7f07bcac125659dc39db2bf153f4b6f0f6dba83c7e4fd4071aa",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（愤怒地吼叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "魔法......魔法......唔，感觉无论用什么魔法都会伤到小刻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "几位，请你们帮我压制住小刻，我来安抚她的情绪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "说是这么说，但是这家伙也太能闹腾了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......森西，我们之前吃的爆米花还有剩下的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "丢一把给小刻试试！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "话音未落，森西就从口袋中掏出一把爆米花，朝着刻俄柏扔去。\n而刚才还在发怒的刻俄柏立刻像是被吸引住了一样看向爆米花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "果然，她还是想吃东西的——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可能是她在路上吃了些什么东西，把肚子吃坏了，所以才变成了这样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......真的会有人吃坏了肚子变成魔物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "凯尔希医生和我说过，小刻的身上有特殊的血脉，确实是有这种可能的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的假的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "之后再聊吧，趁现在把小刻压制住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "拿剑的，背锅的，你们两个看起来力气比较大，我们一起控制住她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯&森西",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "趁着刻俄柏在吃爆米花的工夫，三人小心地从背后接近，分别抱住她的三条腿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（不开心地吼叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "趁现在，阿米娅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回来吧，小刻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别害怕，这里是你的家呀......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（吃痛吼叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好厉害，她用的魔法我从来没见过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快看，小刻变回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小刻，你没事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......刚刚......怎么了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我好像......做了个梦......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "梦？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刻俄柏环视四周，原本摆放整齐的房间被撞得七扭八歪，自己手中还攥着半个坏掉的玩具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "对不起......火神大姐说了，做错了事就要说对不起，我好像做错事了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在梦里好饿......肚子咕噜地叫了一下......然后......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然后......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然后我就长出了好多个脑袋，想吃很多很多东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要肚子吃饱了，我就很高兴，就又回到这里来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）......角峰，火神在哪里？她最近有发现这个情况吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）我待会儿去问问她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）那小刻现在......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......咕噜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？小刻，你肚子又饿了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想吃好多好多东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在梦里吃饱了，可现在还是很饿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你知道，一个长着三个脑袋的怪物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我当然知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "它是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不只是三个脑袋，是一千个脑袋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小刻每次都想吃好多好多的东西，长十个......一百个，啊不对，一千个！一千个脑袋都吃不够！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小刻有一千个脑袋哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯小队",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么？？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要肚子吃饱了，我就不会变成刚刚那样了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好！那老夫现在就给你好好地做一顿饭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们这次先破例在饭前就给小刻吃一点零食，再带她做一下检查......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "几位客人，不如你们先在罗德岛上好好转转，等开饭时间再大展身手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......多、多谢了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "至于各位来到罗德岛的另一个目的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回到你们原本的地方......我们可能需要一些时间来了解你们的事情，然后再做出判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸......那我们现在......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不用太过担心，博士和凯尔希医生或许会有办法的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯。无论如何，你们帮助过小刻，而且，情况也十分特殊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你们不介意的话，就先在罗德岛上逗留一段时间吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我代表罗德岛欢迎你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "又来新人了？是哪个部门的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "奇怪，看不出种族呢，是把尾巴藏起来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老夫刚看到有个姑娘抱着很多作物过去了，能带老夫去看看你们这里的田地吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "田地......是说培养舱、水培舱之类的吗？跟我来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你们这里有酒馆吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......噢，原来你是杜林人！那过来吧，在这边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们......你们这里有可以好好洗一个澡、梳理一下头发的地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "噗，宿舍里都有的，跟我来好啦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，好长的兔子耳朵，上次没能看清里面毛细血管的分布，有些可惜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哇，他们会巧妙地调整尾巴的位置来维持身体平衡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......明明长了羽毛却没有翅膀，那他们会飞吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，这里简直是天堂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员D",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，他就是刚刚说的新干员吗？是不是迷路了又不好意思开口麻烦别人，所以就站在路中间了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员E",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可能是有点害羞，要不我们先去开口打个招呼吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员E",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你好，请问你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）所以这些鸟人会下蛋吗？如果是没有受精的蛋的话，能够拿来尝一下味道吗？这里这么多人，应该可以要到一些吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）羊人的毛能不能用来做毛衣呢？可是刚才看到的几个人，手臂似乎很光滑，不像是会长毛的样子。好可惜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）不过还有更值得在意的事情，好想知道猫人和狗人生下来的孩子是猫还是狗？还是说是半猫半狗？......上猫下狗？左猫右狗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小声）......那要是和鸟人一起生呢？是生下来一颗蛋，然后从里面破壳出来一只猫吗？嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（集体后退半步）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（再次集体后退半步）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我有个问题想问下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的干员们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（再一次集体后退半步）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你们围在这里做什么呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你会下蛋吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你在问我吗？我肯定不会。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她肯定也不会。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，他肯定没问你，你不用专门出来回答。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗯？啊！不好意思，我是想问刚刚那几个鸟......黎博利的......咦？他们都去哪了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "大家怎么都站得离我那么远？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗯......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "再也不好奇的干员D",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "阿米娅！就是他！就是他！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "再也不好奇的干员E",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "他不是病人，是刚刚被发现在甲板上醒来的......“客人”！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "再也不好奇的干员F",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但是他、他他他一直在碎碎念超级可怕的问题！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊......他问什么了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "再也不好奇的干员D",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "他问我们会不会生下半猫半狗！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "再也不好奇的干员E",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "他问黎博利会不会生蛋，能不能吃！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（嘶鸣）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊，啊，好帅气，你叫Mon3tr吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我可以摸你吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（尖锐的嘶鸣）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（利索的动作）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呃——呃啊？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蜜蜡",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哇，那你平时在迷宫里冒险，都没有办法好好保养头发，却仍然有着这么一头好看的金发吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哼哼~因为头发对魔法师而言是很重要的，头发里面也有一部分我的魔力~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蜜蜡",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "给你看，这个是我平时用来保养头发的油膏，里面加了香料和药草提取物，可以有效滋润和防护。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "蜜蜡",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我要经常涂抹，才能有现在这样的效果呢！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "唔，好香的油膏！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要是想要头发变得好看，我还有很多编发小技巧可以教给你们哦！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你、跑、什、么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "老夫只是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呃啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你刚刚用我的火干了什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呃......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我问你刚刚用我的火干了什么？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......烤栗子......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "......\n烤、\n栗、\n子！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "烤栗子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那个开拖拉机的姑娘给了老夫一些生栗子，说这是她在罗德岛上种出来的第一批栗子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你们这里的田地打理得很好，栗子作为零食是很不错的食物，烤熟后香甜软糯，壳也好剥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "只可惜刚刚你身上的火有些大了！这几个栗子都烤焦了。说要给你们做一顿饭尝尝，没想到却浪费了食材，老夫觉得很惭愧......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "天火",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薄绿",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "天火学姐、天火学姐，你别生气呀......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薄绿",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊啊，阿消，阿消！快来！天火学姐又烧起来了！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "薄绿",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "大叔，你也别再往里面扔肉串了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "咕咚！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......确实好喝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呼——不过都说了我不是杜林人了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "山",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "山",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那你其实是个孩子？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你能坐下来说话吗，我根本看不到你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "山",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我已经坐下来了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "再来一杯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "银灰",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "多谢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你们这里的男性都这么高吗？莱欧斯似乎也没有这么高......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（小声）这个银白色、毛茸茸的人......莱欧斯要是见到他，估计只会想着问他需不需要帮他梳梳毛......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......算了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "都在这里喝酒？怎么不叫我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "好久不来一趟，你们都不记得让我也来尝尝了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗯？哪里来的小孩子？小孩可不能喝酒啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗯......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "咕咚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（嗅嗅嗅）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（这里有好香的味道！！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（饭已经做好了吗？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（好吃的在这里！！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "冲呀！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "老夫的腰——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（呜啊，撞到人了......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "对不起！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "火神大姐说了，撞到人要说对不起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "对不起胡子大叔！撞到你是因为我饿了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "好了，都端上来吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "用我们一路上遇到的人提供的食材和回忆做的饭，已经全部做好了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "来尝尝看，和之前的味道还一样吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "唔......刚刚准备食材的时候就想问了，为什么这回还要做一模一样的料理呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "和之前吃的料理味道一样的话，心情会更好吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......这个老夫也不是很确定。但是吃到一模一样的食物的话，老夫总是会想起上一次吃下同样食物时的心情。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "就像说到蝎子火锅，玛露西尔你会想起什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......第一次在新手广场，和你见面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "走路菇的脚也很好吃，有一股奇特的香味。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "蝎子拆起来挺难的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "蛇尾鸡呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你说什么也要把解毒草放进鸡肉里烹饪成食物给那个探险者吃下......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "蛇尾鸡很帅气！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "玛露西尔终于吃到她想吃的鸡肉了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "曼德拉草呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "它的头长得很有特色！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "玛露西尔被大蝙蝠......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——那件事就不要再提啦！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你看，就是这样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "食物是和记忆连接在一起的，吃到同样的料理，脑中也会出现那时的画面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "老夫做饭的时候也会想起当时一起做饭的人，为什么会选择做这道料理？准备食材时发生了什么事？吃完之后有没有露出幸福的笑容？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这样子一点一滴，都会在同样的香气和味道里再次浮现。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "而这一顿饭的画面，也会作为这份料理的新的记忆存在在脑海中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哇......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "森西总是能说出很厉害的话......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那么，开饭吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "开心的小队",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "开饭咯！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "呣~萝卜料理好好吃！博士要不要尝尝？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你真的不试试吗？真的吗？烤源石虫很好吃的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "尝一个呗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哇......这些小刻都可以吃吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "可以的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "全部都可以？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "全部都可以~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你们对小刻真好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "对了......“博士”，是吗？老夫刚刚有注意到你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "刚刚做饭时那些干员和老夫说，你经常忙着做事，忘了吃饭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要不就总是草草吃一顿就糊弄了，有时还吃一些不健康的提神或者是饱腹用的食品......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森西",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这样很不好，要记得这对健康没有好处，还有不少人都在关心你呢！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
